The right framework is the one your team can keep alive. Here are our criteria.

## Astro for content sites

Static pages by default, interactive islands on demand: ideal for a very fast showcase site or blog.

## Laravel for applications

Authentication, queues, e-mails, payments: **everything is built in** for a business application.

## Wagtail for editorial teams

A real editorial CMS: page tree, StreamField, revisions and previews.
